g><path d="M780 274 V282" class="tick"/><text x="780" y="294" class="mi" text-anchor="middle">8</text></g><g><path d="M870 274 V282" class="tick"/><text x="870" y="294" class="mi" text-anchor="middle">9</text></g><g><path d="M960 274 V282" class="tick"/><text x="960" y="294" class="mi" text-anchor="middle">10</text></g><g><path d="M1050 274 V282" class="tick"/><text x="1050" y="294" class="mi" text-anchor="middle">11</text></g><g><path d="M1140 274 V282" class="tick"/><text x="1140" y="294" class="mi" text-anchor="middle">12</text></g><text x="14" y="294" class="mi">MILE</text>{%- assign cdots = get_content_items(ContentType="callouts", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=60) -%}{% for c in cdots.Items %}{%- assign y=c.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture dk -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign dx = y.mile | append: "" | plus: 0 | times: 90 | plus: 60 -%}{%- assign off = forloop.index0 | modulo: 3 | times: 15 | minus: 15 -%}{%- assign dy = 150 | plus: off -%}<a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}"><title>{{ y.ref }} · {{ c.PrimaryField }}</title><circle cx="{{ dx }}" cy="{{ dy }}" r="9" class="dot" style="fill:{% case dk %}{% when "water" %}#e0531f{% when "vessel" %}#1d5f8a{% when "animal" %}#d99a1e{% when "search" %}#6a4c93{% when "flood" %}#2f8f8a{% when "medical" %}#b8324a{% else %}#10263d{% endcase %}"/></a>{% endfor %}</svg><ul class="legend"><li><i style="background:#e0531f"></i>Person in the water</li><li><i style="background:#1d5f8a"></i>Vessel in difficulty</li><li><i style="background:#d99a1e"></i>Animal rescue</li><li><i style="background:#6a4c93"></i>Search</li><li><i style="background:#2f8f8a"></i>Flood response</li><li><i style="background:#b8324a"></i>Medical on the bank</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><div class="dg" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,420px)"><div><h2>Reach by reach</h2>{%- assign rc = get_content_items(ContentType="callouts", PageSize=200) -%}<div class="tscroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Reach</th><th>Miles</th><th>What it is like</th><th>Callouts in 2026</th><th>The advice</th></tr></thead><tbody>{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{% for c in rc.Items %}{%- capture crr -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.reach }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if crr == "weir" %}{%- assign rn = rn | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<tr><td><a href="{{ PathBase }}/callouts?reach=weir">Hather Weir</a></td><td class="c">0 – 2</td><td>The weir, the weir pool and the mill pond. Strong recirculating current below the weir all year; the pond freezes most winters.</td><td class="c" style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy)">{{ rn }}</td><td>Stay out of the weir pool. Keep dogs on a lead near the ice.</td></tr>{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{% for c in rc.Items %}{%- capture crr -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.reach }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if crr == "town" %}{%- assign rn = rn | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<tr><td><a href="{{ PathBase }}/callouts?reach=town">Town Reach</a></td><td class="c">2 – 5</td><td>The town bridge, the riverside walk and the station slipway. Swimmers, anglers and the most bank-side visitors.</td><td class="c" style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy)">{{ rn }}</td><td>Use the throw line stations; don't swim near the bridge piers.</td></tr>{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{% for c in rc.Items %}{%- capture crr -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.reach }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if crr == "marina" %}{%- assign rn = rn | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<tr><td><a href="{{ PathBase }}/callouts?reach=marina">Marina Reach</a></td><td class="c">5 – 8</td><td>Moorings, pontoons and the channel. Busy with boats from April to October.</td><td class="c" style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy)">{{ rn }}</td><td>Wear a buoyancy aid on the pontoons; keep to the channel.</td></tr>{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{% for c in rc.Items %}{%- capture crr -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.reach }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if crr == "marsh" %}{%- assign rn = rn | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<tr><td><a href="{{ PathBase }}/callouts?reach=marsh">Saltmarsh</a></td><td class="c">8 – 10.5</td><td>Creeks and soft mud that flood fast on the incoming tide. Most of our searches start here.</td><td class="c" style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy)">{{ rn }}</td><td>Check the tide before you walk out, and turn back early.</td></tr>{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{% for c in rc.Items %}{%- capture crr -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.reach }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if crr == "bar" %}{%- assign rn = rn | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<tr><td><a href="{{ PathBase }}/callouts?reach=bar">The Bar</a></td><td class="c">10.5 – 12</td><td>Where the river meets the sea over a shifting sandbar. Breaking water on the ebb.</td><td class="c" style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy)">{{ rn }}</td><td>Cross the Bar only on the flood, and never on an inflatable.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
